title They kicked it over your goal line
intro Red has the ball in front of your goal.
flip vertical

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player R-RF at 35.7, 29.9
  ball with R-RF

step
  caption Red has the ball and is attacking your goal.

step
  caption Red shoots — it misses the net and goes over your goal line.
  ball to -5.3, 10.9
  arrow from R-RF to ball
  draw goal-line left
  duration 1450

question
  prompt What restart is it?
  answer Goal kick
  wrong Throw-in
  wrong Corner
  wrong Kick-off
  why They last touched it over your goal line, so you restart with a goal kick.

step
  caption You get a goal kick from the box by your goal.
  B-G to 8.4, 34
  ball with B-G
  draw goal-area left
  banner Goal kick
